Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Yamada Cram School"\N"Accepting new students"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, um... This is my first day here, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be Mr. Kagaya. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents told me you'd be coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.95,0:00:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there was a supermarket\NI'd never seen before on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have these flavors\Nat the one by my house, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus both my parents work, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can teach you some\Nsimple recipes for next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're interested, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We've even got a kitchen in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,In a cram school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.91,0:00:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, in a cram school. Pretty weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like everyone's here.\NLet me introduce you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi... Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi! Are you okay?! It's me!\NDo you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.91,0:01:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I had a weird dream...\NDid I just imagine it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.91,0:01:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember it at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.41,0:01:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Where's Yoshioka?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, please look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.25,0:01:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but you don't have your glasses on.\NI guess it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mentioned it earlier--\Nwhen we were looking for my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awake, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.45,0:01:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Found your clothes! Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.12,0:01:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I found your wallet, too.\NIt was in the rubble over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can talk it over once we're back\Nwith everyone else, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of us now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.62,0:03:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Shuichi, let me ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember any of\Nwhat happened before you passed out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka, same for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Umm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we entered the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a boy holding Yoshioka's\Nwallet--we think he was Clair's ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He suddenly turned into a monster, grabbed us...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.41,0:04:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I feel like he just... crushed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, here you are, standing in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there only one of them?\NShe wasn't there, was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.33,0:04:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew they were dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.91,0:04:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But you ran in on your own\Nand put Yoshioka in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Ikeuchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right. Shuichi's actions\Nwere extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Still... I kinda like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,At least, more than someone\Nwho'd just abandon his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're safe. We got the wallet back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:05:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All's well that ends well. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Yota Murakami. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi Kagaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll be a worthy rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nice to meet you, Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Isao Kasuga.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, was that a weird way to introduce myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.95,0:05:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just thought you'd be... bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... My monster form looks tough,\Nbut I'm not much of a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually like flowers and plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got crazy powers, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He can grow plants and alter earth at will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,These are for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I'm wrong here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:06:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you go to Yamada Cram School\Nwhen you were little?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I live around there...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to see you hanging out\Nwith all your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I never talked to you guys or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but you all seemed to have\Na lot of fun--I kind of envied you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.58,0:06:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird. I never hung out\Nwith anyone at cram school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the only student at Yamada Cram School.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're remembering\Nsome other group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? That's weird. But, yeah. Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you say so.\NI must be thinking of something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.16,0:06:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you say hello, Aihara?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.95,0:06:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounded like a girl... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.91,0:06:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out, Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Presenting Miku Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:07:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She can turn invisible! Jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd thought of that power.\NYou could do all kinds of naughty stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely one of the most\Nuseful powers out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've seen her somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.29,0:07:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to heat this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh! You're from the convenience store!\N--Oh! You're from the convenience store!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should introduce myself too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Sayaka Koyanagi, the leader of the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a total lesbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.29,0:07:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get back on topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what probably happened:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you were grabbed by\Nthat boy and passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, some other force appeared,\Nand they started fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.29,0:07:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In the ensuing chaos, you were\Nforgotten and spared because of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.29,0:07:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:08:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing's for certain:\NThere was a huge fight there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a war between two big teams, or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You mentioned your sister before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She probably came back with her friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah! That must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that seems likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.75,0:08:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears the fight over the coins\Nis more heated than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we must not run from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let dangerous people\Nlike them gain that power!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it's the coins we're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.45,0:08:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Strength will not always be the deciding factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We have our own way of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You've shown us your powers,\Nso now--just to prove we're on your side--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll show you ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an impressive skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.87,0:09:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that give you an idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... With you on our side,\Nour strength improves greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yota? Do you think you could take them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I don't know. I'm not too confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pass. I don't want to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.70,0:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those marks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure you two will be a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is going down. Let's call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, don't you?\NYou remember what happened out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the same as Shuichi.\NI don't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you upset that I went inside of Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you aren't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi needs me. Nobody can replace me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.41,0:10:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Without me, he's not capable\Nof fighting or hurting others...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought:\NYou two are completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You two cannot become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mad at me for running off\Ninto danger like that without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something appealing\Nabout eating in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? You have something\Nyou want to say to me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was better? Me... Or that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She went inside you, didn't she?\NAnd she was naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.41,0:11:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I mean she kind of had to...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Had to? So, is that why you let me in, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to, I can do something\Nthat'll make you feel even better...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hah! Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The noodles are getting soggy. Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell. That girl is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.83,0:12:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yota said that was a fight between two teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But if it was, there should have\Nbeen more blood and footprints around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She showed up and fought to save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.87,0:12:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But... Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You two cannot become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that you, Abukawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.95,0:13:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaga! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking a walk. It's hot,\Nand I couldn't sleep, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it got hit by a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on a walk to and found the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't just leave it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.83,0:13:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. I've only got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you really do look like\Na different person without your glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For real? You'll get arrested!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what up, Abukawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that? Why are you up\Nat the buttcrack of dawn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you, man!\NGo buy me a drink or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.95,0:14:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Psh. You trying to bum\Nmoney off a high schooler?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"The following day -- After school"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That dead animal... Did he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But Abukawa was like a\Ntotally different person last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.83,0:14:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's fixed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, Mifune...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If something's bothering you, you can tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god! Now he's with another girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:15:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He might look tame, but he's a real shithead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, once Yoshioka and the others see this--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't talk without the\Nfreckled freak by your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't the one that killed Sudo, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,His body was cut clean\Nin half by some kind of blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.70,0:15:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the way you were fighting yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit it out! What are you plotting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you tell them about Sanbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, it wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We happened on his body in the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and Clair grabbed the phone off of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not lying, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, you entered Koyanagi's pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't betray us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.37,0:15:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What does she mean, "big help"?!\NDon't you get cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even fight unless someone helps you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:16:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I can do things\Nthat can't be done alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My power is not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It exists to protect "normal"\Npeople--the powerless ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.45,0:16:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be for someone...\NSomeone in this story...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your phone keeps buzzing, it's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Chihiro Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.12,0:16:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an acquaintance of Shuichi's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.37,0:16:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't like talking\Nto people I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wai--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.20,0:17:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that Naoto calling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm going to leave for a bit.\NYou need to go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.83,0:17:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't treat me like a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! I, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the girl who was one with Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So... You do know what that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi and I were completely together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.58,0:17:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits, bodies...\NEven our memories blended into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We were neither me nor him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to us? Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a special power...\NA power that only Shuichi has.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He joins with someone,\Nand their strength is combined...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows them to exceed\Ntheir limits and achieve their goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an extremely powerful ability...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.41,0:18:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the two have the same goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.20,0:18:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how did you get this number?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I never gave it to my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.79,0:18:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it from Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Shuichi\Ncould remember this number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something silly like\Nthat again, and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When I became one with him,\NI saw his memories and noticed it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There are shadows in his memories--\Nshadows of things erased unnaturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"I hung out with **** today."\NThere are shadows in his memories--\Nshadows of things erased unnaturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"I hung out with **** today."\NI don't think even he would notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.91,0:18:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"I ****ed ****'s clothes" "**** was smiling"\N"**** was having fun ****" "**** said **** liked it"\N"Me and ****'s present"\NI don't think even he would notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"**** is always so nice" "On the way home **** and I ****"\N"talked about when we were at"\N"all **** or like ****ed" "Me and **** went to ****"\NI don't think even he would notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"went to hang out at ****"  "when I tried to ****"\N"I did that with **** but"  "was worried about me and"\NI don't think even he would notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"kind of embarrassed but I ****"\N"****'s hand"\NOnly someone viewing his memories\Nobjectively, from outside, could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"a **** was ****"\N"It **** with"  "**** also ****"\NOnly someone viewing his memories\Nobjectively, from outside, could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"****ed *****"\N"was ****'s"  "did **** ****"\NOnly someone viewing his memories\Nobjectively, from outside, could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.37,0:18:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Only someone viewing his memories\Nobjectively, from outside, could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:19:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Those shadows... I don't know\Nhow or why they were erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.95,0:19:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You and the shadows look the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,His memories might disappear,\Nbut maybe there are some spaces
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in Shuichi's heart that can't be blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"I miss ****"\Nin Shuichi's heart that can't be blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't all of them, they were fragmented--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But as I filled those shadows with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to see Shuichi's lost memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't told Shuichi\Nabout this or anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.95,0:19:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't remember anything\Nfrom the time when we were one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know! You're not a bad person!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.45,0:19:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, for Shuichi,\Nnobody could take your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, join us! If we work together,\Nwe can stop this conflict!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The power the alien talked about...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What if someone actually got power that--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.33,0:19:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How many gatherers have you encountered so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.25,0:19:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.75,0:20:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The alien said you need 100 coins, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.66,0:20:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think gathering that\Nmany coins is actually impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What if someone had already gathered 100 coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And what if the world was already on\Nthe brink of destruction because of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.87,0:20:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I cannot join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi and I have different goals now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who were you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.37,0:20:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard we lost a kill today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Subaru says they were pretty tough,\Nbut suddenly collapsed--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.00,0:20:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And as he was about to finish them,\Nyou stepped in and stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.87,0:20:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that not concern us, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:20:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten my role.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We are here to gather coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone gets in our way, we eliminate them--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only five.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how many coins we've found\Nsince we came here two months back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll never collect 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've learned something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.95,0:21:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you put together the locations\Nof the first coins we collected,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and the ones we found in the forest,\Na pattern emerges.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.66,0:22:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The trail of the fallen spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. The thing we're\Nafter is the ship itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.66,0:22:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.75,0:22:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,we can gather 100 coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.20,0:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 9: Staked Claims"
